  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is night. Lily and Tom are in the bedroom. Mom has a book. \"Look!\" says Mom. \"A book about Pip!\" Lily points at the book. \"Pip and the Big Day!\" says Lily.",
      "Mom reads the story. Mom smiles. It is a good story. Pip is a small dog. He has a big day. \"Is Pip happy?\" asks Lily. \"Yes, he is,\" says Mom.",
      "Pip is on the bed. He wants to sleep. Lily smiles. Tom smiles. \"Good night, Pip!\" \"Good night, Lily,\" says Mom. \"Goodbye, day!\" says Lily. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Lily loves her family."
    ],
    "summary": "At night, Mom reads a story book about Pip to Lily and Tom. The name of the book is Pip and the Big Day. Then it is time to say good night.",
